@startuml digital_lottery_sequence_diagram
title Digital Lottery Platform - Purchase Ticket Sequence Diagram (FR-03 to FR-07)

actor Customer

participant "React Frontend" as FE
participant "Nginx Load Balancer" as LB
participant "Purchase Service" as PS
participant "Redis Cache / Lock" as Redis
participant "MongoDB Ticket DB" as MDB
participant "Payment Service" as PAY
participant "PostgreSQL" as PG
participant "RabbitMQ" as MQ
participant "Notification Service" as NOTI
participant "Audit Log Service" as AUDIT

== 1. Search Ticket (FR-03) ==

Customer -> FE : Search lottery number
FE -> LB : GET /tickets?number=xxxx\n[Token in Header]
LB -> PS : Forward request + validate token

PS -> Redis : Check token cache
Redis --> PS : Token valid ✓

PS -> MDB : Query available tickets
MDB --> PS : Ticket list
PS --> FE : Return results

== 2. Reserve Ticket (FR-04) ==

Customer -> FE : Select ticket
FE -> LB : POST /reserve\n[Token in Header]
LB -> PS : Reserve selected ticket + validate token

PS -> Redis : Acquire distributed lock\n(5 min TTL)
Redis --> PS : Lock success

PS -> MDB : Update status = Reserved
MDB --> PS : Success

PS -> AUDIT : Log ticket reservation\n(Action: RESERVE, User ID, Ticket ID)
AUDIT --> PS : Logged ✓

PS --> FE : Reservation confirmed
FE -> Customer : Reservation timer: 5 min (auto-release)

note over Redis
After 5 min with no payment:
Auto-release lock
(NFR-R02 - Reservation Timeout)
end note

== 3. Payment (FR-05) ==

Customer -> FE : Confirm payment\n(PromptPay/Credit Card)
FE -> LB : POST /payment\n[Token in Header]
LB -> PAY : Payment request + validate token

PAY -> Redis : Verify ticket still locked\n(not expired)
Redis --> PAY : Lock valid ✓

PAY -> PG : Save transaction record\n(User ID, Ticket ID, Amount, Status: PENDING)
PG --> PAY : Transaction created

PAY -> PAY : Process payment\n(Call external payment gateway)
note over PAY
PromptPay/Stripe API call
(NFR-R01 - Timeout & Retry: 10s)
end note

PAY -> PG : Update transaction\nStatus: SUCCESS
PG --> PAY : Updated ✓

PAY -> MDB : Update ticket status = SOLD\n(Purchase date, User ID)
MDB --> PAY : Success

PAY -> AUDIT : Log payment transaction\n(Action: PAYMENT, User ID, Amount, Gateway)
AUDIT --> PAY : Logged ✓

== 4. Confirmation & Notification (FR-07, FR-10) ==

PAY -> MQ : Publish purchase event\n(User ID, Ticket ID, Purchase Receipt)
MQ --> PAY : Queued ✓

MQ -> NOTI : Consume event
NOTI -> PG : Store notification record
PG --> NOTI : Stored ✓

NOTI -> NOTI : Send Push Notification\n(Firebase FCM)
NOTI --> Customer : "✓ Purchase successful\nTicket: XXXX\nAmount: $X.XX"

PAY --> FE : Purchase completed\n(Order ID, Receipt)
FE -> Customer : Show purchase confirmation

PAY -> AUDIT : Log purchase completion\n(Action: PURCHASE_COMPLETE, Status: SUCCESS)
AUDIT --> PAY : Logged ✓

@enduml